<title>CHINA: Trading in Tak Wing shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Tak Wing shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Tak Wing Investment (Holdings) Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong Stock Exchange said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Shares of the civil engineering and construction group rose HK$0.42 to end at HK$2.00 on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
